# Vercel CLI uploads everything in this folder that isn't listed here (it does not
# read .gitignore). The runner workspace, worktrees and dependency folders alone are
# ~40k files, far past the CLI's 15,000-file limit. Vercel installs dependencies
# itself, so node_modules must not be uploaded either.
.git
.github-runner
.worktrees
node_modules
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
tests
coverage
Claude outputs
*.bundle
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
scrape.py
scrape.log
requirements.txt
